<title>USA: STB postpones secondary offering.</title>
<headline>STB postpones secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>STB Systems Inc said Tuesday it had postponed its secondary offering of about 1.8 million shares due to current market conditions.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to pursue the offering in the near future.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
